  <h2>What Makes a 19-Band Equalizer Different</h2>

  <p>
    Simple equalizers offer three to five controls: bass, mids, treble. That is enough for rough corrections, but not for targeted work. The 19-Band EQ Pro splits the audible spectrum from 20 Hz to 20 kHz into 19 narrow bands. You can tame a boomy area at 135 Hz without losing the sub-bass, or lift speech intelligibility around 2 to 3 kHz without making sibilants sharper.
  </p>

